Sometimes, above the bridge, you can
see the shadows of bird Pokémon, right?{VAR BE01}
Their feathers drift to the ground here!{VAR BE01}
And when you try to pick them up,
occasionally, you'll run into a Pokémon.

When a ship passes, the bridge raises
and lowers.{VAR BE01}
But Clay controls when the ships run
from the start, so when the bridge{VAR BE00}
raises and lowers is up to Clay.

When Driftveil is mentioned, what comes
to mind is the Cold Storage...{VAR BE00}
and Charles!
